      "clueSentence": "The three-fifths formula handed Jefferson his narrow victory in the presidential election of 1800 by inflating the votes of the southern states in the Electoral College.",
      "explanation": "【王晶婷六大题型·正误判断细节题精析】\n题干要求根据文章判断哪一项陈述是正确的。根据第5段第1~2句：“And the statesmen's political lives depended on slavery. The three-fifths formula handed Jefferson his narrow victory in the presidential election of 1800 by inflating the votes of the southern states in the Electoral College”（政治家们的政治生命依赖于奴隶制。五分之三折算公式通过虚增南方各州在选举人团中的选票，让杰斐逊在1800年大选中惊险获胜）。这表明杰斐逊等开国元勋在政治上实实在在地享受了奴隶制带来的制度红利，选项 [A]“Some Founding Fathers benefit politically from slavery”与原文完全契合，为正确选项。",
